Architecture (mirrors the accepted AlertsSection/AlertCard gold pattern):
  • Pure Foundation projection core (Adapter + Stats) — every web useMemo ported,
    unit-tested without a bundle.
  • @Observable AlertsListPageModel (P1/S8) bound to an AlertsListSource seam; the
    production AlertsListLiveSource is driven by the shared-core facade through the
    AlertsListProviding seam (P6/ADR-004/ADR-009 integration point). NO networking
    in the view.
  • Reuses the shipped AlertCard component for list rows; reuses the P2 design
    tokens (Color.TS/Font.TS/TSSpacing/TSRadius) + P3 components (TSGlassPanel,
    TSSearchInput, TSTabs, TSActiveFilterChips, TSBadge, TSButton, TSSkeleton,
    TSFadeIn/TSStagger…) + TSChartPalette.
  • All AlertsList* types are namespaced to avoid collision with the existing
    Alerts*/Alert* symbols (AlertsSection / AlertCard).
  • Navigation: NotificationsRouteRegistration.registry(base:) registers
    .notifications → AlertsListPage; composed into routeHosts in TeslaSyncApp.swift
    (mirrors SettingsRouteRegistration). AppRouteParser already maps
    /notifications/alerts (+ the /alerts alias) → .notifications.

